---
// The logo: six dots around one signal dot, a qubit's possible outcomes around the state.
---
<a class="brand" href="/">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="32" height="32" rx="7" fill="currentColor"/><g fill="var(--paper)"><circle cx="8" cy="16" r="1.6"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="1.6"/><circle cx="12" cy="22" r="1.6"/><circle cx="20" cy="10" r="1.6"/><circle cx="20" cy="22" r="1.6"/><circle cx="24" cy="16" r="1.6"/></g><circle cx="16" cy="16" r="2.6" fill="var(--signal)"/></svg>
  Quantum Computing Era
</a>

<style>
  .brand { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: .6rem; min-height: 2.75rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -.02em; text-decoration: none }
  svg { width: 28px; height: 28px; flex: none }
</style>
